helper.md and brief.md are pi-better's, as written upstream. helper.md is built on the "Depth" prompt from Felix
Rieseberg's "How to be more ambitious: A tutorial for humans with models"
(https://felixrieseberg.com/how-to-be-more-ambitious-a-tutorial-for-humans-with-models/#depth).

pi-phone's /better (src/server/better.ts) sends them to a read-only copy of the session, as pi-better's /better does
with a `pi -p` process; the task's framing around them (the prompt to deepen, the <improved-prompt> block to end
with) follows pi-better's better.ts.
